// search.Operator enum, the CheckAlertState union cluster, DataScope, and the MetadataChange union cluster are
// modeled inline: their Conjure source types (common.yml / global.yml / unified-search.yml / asset-service-api.yml)
// are not yet migrated to proto, and asset.proto already imports nominal/protos/run/v1/run.proto — so importing
// nominal.asset.v2 from here would form a package cycle the per-package proto-module build cannot represent. Each
// `(nominal.gen.v1.alias)` repoints at the real Conjure class so the generated typed accessors return the existing
// Conjure wrappers, exactly as asset.proto does for the same leaf types.
//
